# Prefill with --kv q8_0: the fast q8_0 dequantization in attend_rows_kernel, the kernel a
# prompt batch's tokens all go through (deepseek4).  Applies on top of deepseek4_q8_0_kv_cache.patch.
#
# The old loop fetched the row's scale from VRAM once per value (8 times for the same
# scale: the 8 values of a 16-byte word never leave their one block of 32) and converted
# a value at a time.  One scale fetch a word and half2 packing cut the instructions of
# the key-staging loop about in half; reading the window's keys is what a prompt's
# attention time is, a key row re-staged for every token that sees it.

